\"Wishing Lantern\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when your lanes are winning early and repeated flat Magic Defense shred will decide the first two objectives.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"glowing-wand\",\"name\":\"Glowing Wand\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"blood-wings\",\"name\":\"Blood Wings\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when enemy healing, shielding, or HP-stacking frontliners are surviving through your second rotation.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"winter-crown\",\"name\":\"Winter Crown\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"blood-wings\",\"name\":\"Blood Wings\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when the enemy can invade and burst you before Ice Retribution or Planets Attack creates distance.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"arcane-boots\",\"name\":\"Arcane Boots\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"magic-boots\",\"name\":\"Magic Boots\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when your jungle path is protected and early kill pressure matters more than maximum cooldown cycling.\"}],\"notes\":\"Jungle setup for games where Cyclops is allowed to farm quickly, contest objectives with Retribution, and chase with Ice Retribution plus S2 speed.\",\"totalCost\":11120,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"magicpower\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicPower\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":375,\"sources\":[\"Enchanted Talisman\",\"Concentrated Energy\",\"Wishing Lantern\",\"Divine Glaive\",\"Blood Wings\"]},{\"key\":\"magicpen\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicPenetration\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Divine Glaive\"]},{\"key\":\"hybridsteal\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hybridLifesteal\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":20,\"sources\":[\"Concentrated Energy\"]},{\"key\":\"hp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hp\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":700,\"sources\":[\"Enchanted Talisman\",\"Concentrated Energy\"]},{\"key\":\"mp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.mana\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":400,\"sources\":[\"Wishing Lantern\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeed\",\"la