ed-time Event\",\"portraitFile\":\"Hero103310-portrait.png\",\"portraitUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/cyclops/Hero103310-portrait-20260604033329.webp\",\"splashUrl\":null,\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Cyclops/Cosmetics\"},{\"name\":\"Super Sportsman\",\"tier\":\"Common\",\"rawTier\":\"Common\",\"tag\":\"Elite\",\"tagSlug\":\"elite\",\"price\":\"Limited-time Event\",\"portraitFile\":\"Hero333-portrait.png\",\"portraitUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/cyclops/Hero333-portrait-20220525165024.webp\",\"splashUrl\":null,\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Cyclops/Cosmetics\"}],\"lore\":{\"backstory\":\"Cyclops is the Starsoul Magician, a one-eyed sorcerer from a distant planet who crash-landed in the Land of Dawn. On his home world, he was considered a prodigy of astronomical magic, capable of bending starlight to his will. The crash destroyed his ship but unlocked the full potential of his planetary magic. Now stranded, Cyclops channels the power of orbiting planets to devastate his enemies while searching for a way to repair his vessel and return home. His single eye sees patterns in the stars that no one else can perceive.\",\"allies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"harley\",\"heroName\":\"Harley\",\"relationship\":\"Fellow magic prodigy and friend\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"diggie\",\"heroName\":\"Diggie\",\"relationship\":\"Timekeeper who studies his extraterrestrial origins\"}],\"rivals\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"zhask\",\"heroName\":\"Zhask\",\"relationship\":\"Rival alien whose swarm threatens his mission\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"helcurt\",\"heroName\":\"Helcurt\",\"relationship\":\"Void creature from a neighboring star system\"}]},\"loreUrlName\":\"$undefined\",\"statsHistory\":[{\"date\":\"2026-09-07\",\"winRate\":51.06,\"pickRate\":0.66,\"banRate\":0.32},{\"date\":\"2026-09-10\",\"winRate\":51.02,\"pickRate\":0.65,\"banRate\":0.33},{\"date\":\"2026-09-16\",\"winRate\":51.08,\"pickRate\":0.67,\"banRate\":0.34},{\"da